Embedded word lists in words.js:

- EFF Large, Short 1, and Short 2 — Electronic Frontier Foundation, CC BY 3.0 US
- 1Password AgileWords (1Password/spg testdata)
- BIP-39 language wordlists (Bitcoin BIPs)
- SLIP-39 (Trezor / satoshilabs slips)
- Monero English mnemonic list
- Diceware original, Beale, and 8k (Arnold G. Reinhold)
- Orchard Street wordlists (sts10)
- Niceware 2^16 list (diracdeltas/niceware, SIL-derived)
- Google 10,000 English (first20hours/google-10000-english)
